    "catalog:tags": "wc, toilet, wall-hung, bathroom",
    "catalog:note": "Wall-hung WC, its cistern concealed in the wall; lid open against the wall. bottom 0.15, rim 0.40, seat 0.42. The pan is an oval outline sweep fixed to the wall, hollowed by a shell 0.015 thick whose top is opened by a round bowl cut. The seat is two half rings that meet on the centre line. The plan shows the pan only.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "Drafting standard key dimensions (practice), unverified: rim 0.40, bottom 0.15, seat 0.42; 0.36 x 0.54 generic practice size, unverified; EN 997 not read. Pan oval and bowl opening generic, unverified. Port sizes from the drafting standard (BS EN 12056-2 conventions), unverified",
